  "title": "Fee schedule | Castle Rock, CO - Official Website",
  "text": "Fee schedule | Castle Rock, CO - Official Website\nSkip to Main Content\nEmail scam alert\nReported email scam targeting Town of Castle Rock eTRAKiT system applicants\nRead On...\nAnnexation\nBuilding\nFee Schedule\nHomeowner Resources\nPlanning\nZoning\nSearch\nHome\nTown Government\nDepartments and Divisions\nDevelopment Services\nFee Schedule\nFee schedule\nDevelopment Services fee schedule\n2026 Fee Schedule (PDF)\nValuation data\nThe Town of Castle Rock utilizes the most recently published International Code Council Building Valuation Data table as a footer / estimation tool for the value of new buildings in Castle Rock. The valuation of a building permit is the actual cost of real property work. The data table is provided as a tool and your actual cost of work may be more or less than what is published by ICC. Please remember taxes and fees based on valuation are due on the total final cost of the project. A reconciliation should be performed at the close of your permit to ensure appropriate fees have been paid.\nDevelopment Impact Fees\nDevelopment Impact Fees are incurred on all new construction in the Town of Castle Rock. These fees allow the Town to continue to provide needed infrastructure to maintain service levels as new construction occurs. They are based on each project's estimated incremental cost to expand the system to accommodate that individual project's growth.\nSystem Development Fees\nSystem Development Fees are incurred on all new construction in the Town of Castle Rock. These fees go toward the cost of new development to tie into the Town's infrastructure systems such as water and sewer. They are based on each project's incremental cost to expand the system to accommodate that individual project's growth.\nUse tax\nUse tax is imposed on construction materials that are utilized in the construction of real property. The use tax is due on the material portion of a project. Once the use tax has been paid on your permit you should present the receipt when purchasing materials as Castle Rock has already collected the Municipal (Castle Rock — 4.2%), and County (Douglas — 1%) portions of the tax. Always keep track of all material purchases for your building permit and retain receipts to verify that sufficient sales / use tax has been paid.\nContact us\nBuilding Division\nEmail Building Division\nPhysical Address\n100 N Wilcox St\nCastle Rock\n,\nCO\n80104\nPhone:\n720-733-3527\nAnnexation\nAbout Annexation\nPioneer Ranch Annexation\nBuilding\nAdopted Building Codes\nBoard of Building Appeals\nBuilding Inspections\nBuilding Reports\nBuilding Use Tax\nCommercial Permits\nAdopted Building Codes\nContractor Registration\nInspections\nContractor Luncheons\nContractor Registration\nEconomic Development Assistance\nElevators and Conveyances\nRe-Roof Checklist\nResidential Decks and Patios\nResidential Permits\nAdopted Building Codes\nContractor Registration\nInspections\nSigns\nFee Schedule\nHomeowner Resources\nHomeowners Building Permits\nHiring a contractor\nClean up resources\nMaintaining your property\nPlanning\n1041 Regulations\nAbout Planning\nDesign Review Board\nDevelopment Activity\nAnnexation Projects\nDevelopment Activity Map\nResidential Entitlements\nThe View\nDevelopment Steps\nDowntown Development\nHistoric Preservation\nCastle Rock Style\nCultural Resource Surveys\nDesign Assistance Program\nDowntown Historic Preservation Grant\nHistoric Preservation Plan\nHistoric Preservation Board\nLocal Restoration Grant Program\nWalking Tour Map\nInterchange Overlay Districts\nNeighborhood Meetings\nPlanning Commission\nUrban Renewal Authority\nVision and Master Plan\nZoning\nBoard of Adjustment\nClean Up Resources\nCode Compliance\nMaintaining Your Residential Property\nConstruction Hours of Operation\nSigns\nSkyline / Ridgeline\nBoard of Adjustment Process\nBoard of Adjustment\nZoning Map\nAccess Online Services\nApply for Jobs\nAttend an Event\nPay Water Bill\nTrack Roadwork\nView Development Activity\nContact Us\n100 N. Wilcox St.\nCastle Rock, CO 80104\nPhone:\n720-896-8696\nTown staff directory\nTown news sign up\nConnect With Us\nFacebook\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nNextdoor\nX\nYouTube\nHelpful Links\nAccess online services\nFact or Fiction?\nFrequently asked questions\nLocal business directory\nTown amenities\nAdmin login\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nHome\nParks & Rec\nWater\nPolice\nFire\nPublic Works\nDevelopment\nAccessibility\nCopyright\nNondiscrimination\nPrivacy\nSite Map\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by\nCivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nArrow Left\nArrow Right\n[]\nSlideshow Left Arrow\nSlideshow Right Arrow",
